      {
        "Id": "36408beabb5247f49a349e9594e6e99f",
        "Title": "Duct / Cable\tNo.\tProfile Curve Type\tProfile Curve Length\tK Value\tCurve Radius\r\n40mm E-DUCT\t1\t\t0.052\t0.015\t1.500\r\n50mm E-DUCT / E-DUCT_EARTH\t2\t\t0.052\t0.015\t1.500\r\n63mm E-DUCT_SDR17.6\t3\t\t0.070\t0.020\t2.000\r\n110mm E-DUCT_SDR17.6 / COMMS_SDR17.6\t4\t\t0.105\t0.030\t3.000\r\n125mm E-DUCT_SDR17.6 / COMMS / ECC_SDR17.6\t5\t\t0.122\t0.035\t3.500\r\n125mm E-DUCT_HDD_SDR11\t6\t\t0.122\t0.035\t3.500\r\n140mm E-DUCT_COMMS_HDD_SDR11\t7\t\t0.122\t0.035\t3.500\r\n160mm E-DUCT_SDR21\t8\t\t0.157\t0.045\t4.500\r\n180mm E-DUCT_HDD_SDR11\t9\t\t0.157\t0.045\t4.500\r\n200mm E-DUCT_SDR21\t10\t\t0.192\t0.055\t5.500\r\nDirect buried HV cable — 1c x 2000mm² Aluminium HV (Incoming feed, Energinet → FRD2A/C (L1/L2/L3))\t11\t\t0.087\t0.025\t2.500\r\nDirect buried HV cable — 1c x 2000mm² Aluminium HV (Incoming feed, Energinet → FRD2A/D (L1/L2/L3))\t12\t\t0.087\t0.025\t2.500\r\nDirect buried HV cable — 1c x 800mm² Aluminium HV (Outgoing feed, FRD2A/C → FRD1A/B (L1/L2/L3))\t13\t\t0.087\t0.025\t2.500\r\nDirect buried HV cable — 1c x 800mm² Aluminium HV (Outgoing feed, FRD2A/D → FRD1A/A (L1/L2/L3))\t14\t\t0.087\t0.025\t2.500\r\nDirect buried cable (generic) — Unarmoured multicore cable, OD ≤ 25mm\t15\t\t0.000\t0.000\t0.000\r\nDirect buried cable (generic) — Unarmoured multicore cable, 25mm < OD ≤ 50mm\t16\t\t0.000\t0.000\t0.000\r\nDirect buried cable (generic) — Unarmoured multicore cable, OD > 50mm\t17\t\t0.000\t0.000\t0.000\r\nDirect buried cable (generic) — Armoured (SWA) multicore cable\t18\t\t0.000\t0.000\t0.000\r\nDirect buried cable (generic) — Single-core cable (armoured or unarmoured)\t19\t\t0.000\t0.000\t0.000\r\nDirect buried cable (generic) — Individually shielded / overall-shielded cable\t20\t\t0.000\t0.000\t0.000\r\nDirect buried cable (generic) — Lead-sheathed cable\t21\t\t0.000\t0.000\t0.000\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n",
